    "created_at": "2022-05-31T17:51:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-31T17:51:41Z",
    "body": "ParseScript just invokes ParseText(x, |Script|) and wraps up a couple values into a record, so if you don't want the \"construct a record\" part it makes more sense invoke ParseText directly, IMO.",
